# Auslan sign images (Signbank-derived, internal school teaching use only).
# NEVER commit these - this repo has a public remote and publishing them would
# be redistribution outside both the CC BY-NC-ND licence and the schools
# statutory educational licence. They are rebuilt in minutes by
# scripts/fetch_auslan_signs.py; manifest.json records exactly what to rebuild.
assets/auslan_signs/*.jpg
assets/auslan_signs/*.png
# manifest.json embeds Signbank's dictionary definitions; it regenerates with
# the images, so it stays local too.
assets/auslan_signs/manifest.json
